Nxaiz 2x" alt="AI Can Build a Website. Can It Build the Right One?" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2160" height="396"></div><div class="category" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4>AI</div><div class="title" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4>AI Can Build a Website. Can It Build the Right One?</div><div class="date" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4>10/1/2026</div></a></div><div class="entry" data-astro-cid-n6egurcx><a class="Entry -sm" href="/blog/enterprise-whatsapp-meta-crm-automation-guide/" data-astro-cid-n6egurcx="true" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4><div class="thumbnail" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4><img src="/_astro/article_5_1_49e6aa2703_i2smm.webp?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz" srcset="/_astro/article_5_1_49e6aa2703_i2smm.webp?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz 1x, /_astro/article_5_1_49e6aa2703_Z7aiR4.webp?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz 2x" alt="Architecting Production WhatsApp & Telegram AI Assistants with Gemini API" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2160" height="396"></div><div class="category" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4>Website Redesign</div><div class="title" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4>Architecting Production WhatsApp & Telegram AI Assistants with Gemini API</div><div class="date" data-astro-cid-gziigdw4>9/22/2026</div></a></div></div><div class="more -offset" data-astro-cid-n6egurcx><a href="/blog/" data-astro-cid-n6egurcx="true" data-astro-cid-s6shze65="true" class="CtaButton -inverse"><span class="border" data-astro-cid-s6shze65></span><span class="ripple" data-astro-cid-s6shze65><span data-astro-cid-s6shze65></span></span><span class="title" data-astro-cid-s6shze65><span data-text="Visit blog" data-astro-cid-s6shze65>Visit blog</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="FaqSection -inverse -fill" id="faq" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="fill" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></div><div class="Container container -size-lg" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-7bogrbt7><div class="header" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><h2 data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>FAQ</h2></div><div class="items" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>What does the typical website redesign or revamp process look like?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Every project starts with understanding your business, users and goals. Before writing code or designing, I analyze your current website, identify technical bottlenecks, and define opportunities for improvement.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> The typical process includes Discovery, architecture planning, high-fidelity UI design, frontend development, API integration, QA and launch. Throughout the project, you'll have full visibility into progress, regular updates, and direct communication with me at every milestone.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> Whether it's a high-converting landing page or a complex web platform, the goal is always the same: create software that looks exceptional, performs flawlessly, and accelerates your business growth.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>What services does MD Sharif Mia provide?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Sharif provides end-to-end AI agent engineering, Meta WhatsApp Cloud API automation pipelines, and high-performance full-stack web applications. From early architecture design to scalable production deployment, clients work directly with an experienced engineer focused on solving real business bottlenecks. We adapt our process to every project while maintaining the same level of quality throughout.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Do you build websites using Webflow or custom code?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>I choose the technology stack based on your business goals rather than forcing every project into the same mold.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> For marketing sites requiring simple content management, Webflow can work. For high-performance products, custom interactions, 60fps animations, or scalable web applications, I build custom solutions using modern technologies like Astro, Next.js, React, GSAP, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Can you help launch an MVP quickly?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Absolutely. I help founders launch functional MVPs rapidly by focusing on core value: validating the product idea and automating critical workflows rather than over-engineering unnecessary bloat.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> I collaborate closely with you to define the essential feature set, wire up live AI or webhook automations, and deliver a polished product ready for real users or investors.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> As your business grows, the architecture cleanly scales into a full production platform without starting over.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Which CMS do you recommend?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>The best CMS depends on your content structure, scalability requirements, and team workflow rather than what's popular.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> For simple content management, headless CMS platforms like Strapi or Sanity provide exceptional performance and clean API endpoints. For static and high-speed docs, file-based Markdown/MDX in Astro is often the most cost-effective and secure solution.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> I will help you evaluate and pick the exact architecture that fits your project's long-term scale.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Do you work on fixed-price projects or Time & Materials?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Both pricing models are available. For projects with a clearly defined scope, timeline and deliverables, a fixed-price model provides predictable budgeting and milestones.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> For evolving products, startups or long-term partnerships, Time & Materials offers greater flexibility, allowing priorities to change as the project grows.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Do you offer SEO services?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Yes. I engineer every website following strict technical SEO best practices: semantic HTML5, fast server-rendered markup, OpenGraph &amp; Twitter cards, JSON-LD structured data, and top-tier Core Web Vitals scores.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> If you need deep site audits, search indexing enhancements, or performance tuning, I handle the complete technical optimization from frontend to server headers.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div><details class="item" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><summary class="item__toggle" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><span class="item__title" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>My website has poor PageSpeed scores. Can you help improve them?</span><span class="item__arr" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix></span></summary><div class="item__content" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="item__text" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix>Absolutely. Slow performance usually stems from unoptimized assets, render-blocking scripts, heavy runtime libraries, or uncompressed media. I conduct a thorough profiling audit to pinpoint exact bottlenecks.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> Then I implement code splitting, modern WebP/AVIF formats, server caching, and lightweight component islands to achieve 90+ PageSpeed and sub-second load times.</p><p data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix> This directly improves user retention, lowers bounce rates, and boosts conversion for your business.</p></div></div></details><div class="divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix><div class="Divider" data-astro-cid-u6ssrhix="true" data-astro-cid-jqyytg4m></div></div></div></div></section><script is:inline type="module" src="/_astro/index.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.DHNwXhyW.js?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz"></script><section class="OutroSection" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><div class="bg" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><div class="bg__media" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><img src="/_astro/bg.BbFVEA79_ZPnPpw.jpg?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz" srcset="/_astro/bg.BbFVEA79_ZPnPpw.jpg?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz 1x, /_astro/bg.BbFVEA79_21cPbT.jpg?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz 2x" alt data-astro-cid-ejdhoips="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1920" height="692"></div></div><div class="content" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><div class="Container" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips="true" data-astro-cid-7bogrbt7><div class="header" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><h2 data-astro-cid-ejdhoips>Have an AI automation or software to build?</h2></div><div class="text" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><p data-astro-cid-ejdhoips>Let's discuss how AI agents, WhatsApp workflows, or full-stack software can accelerate your business operations.</p></div></div></div><script is:inline type="module" src="/_astro/index.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.kL_H5pmt.js?dpl=dpl_H9hBbGT2XCmvNrfob5SRvQoNxaiz"></script></section><footer class="Footer" id="contacts" data-astro-cid-5lvg3j4a=""><div class="Container container" data-astro-cid-5lvg3j4a